    sffi_out_param_capability_violation_blocks_stage2_2026-08-27, 2, "2026-11-04 bootstrap triage (c): needs a working self-hosted stage3 to verify or repro; cannot be settled with the Rust seed bin/simple.exe. Exact steps: (1) fresh worktree rebased on origin/release/1.0.0 with no other bootstrap running; (2) SIMPLE_NO_STUB_FALLBACK=1 sh scripts/bootstrap/bootstrap-from-scratch.sh --full-bootstrap --deploy (sanctioned bootstrap; yields build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple and stage3-command.transcript); (3) replay the Symptom/Repro section of doc/08_tracking/bug/sffi_out_param_capability_violation_blocks_stage2_2026-08-27.md with that stage3 binary under a timeout (stage3 cmd form: build/bootstrap/stage3/<triple>/simple native-build <entry> ..., or replay stage3-command.transcript) and capture rc plus last 50 log lines; (4) append the observed rc and log here and set status closed if it no longer reproduces."
    sffi_out_param_capability_violation_blocks_stage2_2026-08-27, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep4: the doc's Stage-2-shaped dynamic.spl probe already passed pre-fix (routed around by 69dec767b75/b86d8a4bfa7 address-form slots), but the canonical retry idiom (var value + two disjoint sequential &mut value at spl_wffi_try_call_i64_out) failed pre-fix with the doc's exact Aliasing violation: reference 2 already has Exclusive capability. Root cause: hir/lower/expr/operators.rs:381-387 acquires Exclusive into capability_env for every &mut and nothing releases it until the function ends, so a second disjoint sequential re-borrow trips can_acquire. Fix (hir/lower/expr/calls.rs +21): when the resolved callee is an extern fn, snapshot capability_env before lowering the call's arguments and restore after the call is built (borrow lifetime = the call); borrows acquired before the call stay active; two &mut of one local in ONE call's arg list still conflict; same checkpoint pattern the file uses for proven_nonescaping callees. Verification on the fixed driver: 3 new lifetime_tests (3/3, module 38/38), retry probe compiled=1 failed=0, Stage-2-shaped probe 78/78, single-borrow control pass, full bootstrap_main Stage-2 run zero capability errors, simple-compiler --lib 5129 passed / 13 failed with ZERO hir:: failures (the 13 are all in other agents' concurrently-edited modules). An SPipe spec cannot regression-test this (specs run the pure-Simple compiler, which has no capability pass) - the Rust tests are the RED/GREEN artifact per the file's precedent. Residuals: the flat snapshot also rolls back inner borrows of nested extern calls (documented; the production MIR borrow stage remains the enforcing layer); full 770-file bootstrap did not reach Build complete under host contention (worker admission timeouts, not compile errors; recipe in the fix doc). close_evidence reproducer=src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/hir/lower/tests/lifetime_tests.rs prevention=doc/07_guide/compiler/sffi_out_param_capability_reverification.md"

